/P 55 0 R
/E (In the winter of 2008, as the global financial crisis was dismantling the balance sheets of banks and the confidence of consumers, most luxury brands did what brands do in downturns: they discounted. Private sales, outlet channels, staff events, discreet price reductions that preserved the appearance of full price while quietly moving inventory.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [3]
>>
