130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (This is the question the series has been building toward, and this case study is where it becomes inescapable. If price is a product decision. If the brain constructs the experience of luxury partly from the number on the tag. If scarcity and inaccessibility are features, not side effects. Then what is the luxury brand actually selling?)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
