133 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (The wine in the scanner tasted better at forty-five dollars than it did at five, despite being the same wine. The bag at the sample sale was smaller than the bag on the shelf, despite being the same bag. The product did not change. The experience of the product changed. And in luxury, the experience of the product is the product.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [7]
>>
